{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28071","headline":"南野逢田客 · 杨发","name":"南野逢田客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桑柘悠悠水蘸堤，晚风晴景不妨犂。\n高机犹织卧蚕子，下坂未饥逢饲妻。\n杏色满林羊酪熟，麦凉浮壠雉媒低。\n生时自乐死由命，万事在天管不迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨发","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28071.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28071","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}